Skip changelog: CI-infrastructure only (no user-facing API change). Adds .github/workflows/windows-ci.yaml, which runs the documented uv workflow from the committed uv.lock on [self-hosted, gpu-windows] runners: a kit-less lane (ovrtx + usd-exchange import coexistence, windows_ci unit tests, shared Newton Cartpole smoke) and an Isaac Sim lane (Kit boot, Isaac Sim PhysX training, RTX camera smoke), plus a wheel build.
